{"id":"n72285-1-10","stage":4,"title":"일과 · 日程","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72285-1-10-1","ko":"오늘 일과는 다 끝나셨어요?","zh":"今天的工作都做完了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"일과는","meaning":"日程，工作","explanation":"일과：日程，工作；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"일과","audio":"/audio/41577f4d50cc707e1242.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72285","senseId":"1","lemma":"일과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일과는","audio":"/audio/f20f4f7370bead3cb842.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"끝나셨어요?","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝나셨어요","audio":"/audio/7ab7eb8f4ea1640c6e9c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"41577f4d50cc707e","term":"일과","zh":"日程，工作","audio":"/audio/41577f4d50cc707e1242.mp3","entryId":"72285","definition":"定下来的每天要做的事。","pronunciation":["일과"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/32d785d55455958ec2ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72285-1-10-2","ko":"아니요. 일이 좀 남아서 야근을 해야 돼요.","zh":"没有。还有点工作没做完，得加班呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"남아서","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남아서","audio":"/audio/bccdeedc0f47035b105f.mp3"}},{"text":"야근을","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야근을","audio":"/audio/0b51441a9a56ccb1685f.mp3"}},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야","audio":"/audio/c8f942c39d369acda96c.mp3"}},{"text":"돼요.","meaning":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","explanation":"되다：应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"18","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼요","audio":"/audio/9f1cdf460348e44aca12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]},{"id":"e8aeeb6fc5aa42e2","term":"야근","zh":"加班","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3","entryId":"90303","definition":"过了下班时间后工作到很晚。","pronunciation":["야ː근"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"应该、必须（-아/어야 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/22e11dd3efc3a7b0130a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.582,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72285","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"